<title>SWEDEN: S&amp;P places Stadshypotek on credit watch.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P places Stadshypotek on credit watch.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. ratings agency Standard &amp; Poor's said on Friday it placed Swedish mortgage bank Stadshypotek AB on credit watch with a long-term rating of A- and a short-term one of A-2, with positive implications.</p>
</text>
